---
layout: base.njk
title: Sponsor the Lenches newsletter
description: "Sponsor the free weekly newsletter and community website for the Lenches villages near Evesham, one local business a month."
permalink: /sponsor/
noindex: true
search: false
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
feedback: false
signup: false
---
{#- Unlisted selling page for sponsor of the month (14 Nov 2026, wording approved by Jon). Not in the menu,
    sitemap or search; Holly's approach email links here. Figures from src/_data/sponsors.json audience. -#}
{%- set a = sponsors.audience -%}
<main class="sponsor-page">
  <section class="sp-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="sp-kicker">Sponsor of the month</p>
      <h1>Sponsor the Lenches newsletter</h1>
      <p class="lead">The Lenches Website and its free weekly newsletter keep five villages in touch: events, news, roads, bins and local services, all in one place, updated daily. Each month, one local business can support it.</p>
      <p class="sp-hero-meta"><strong>&pound;{{ sponsors.price }} a month</strong> &middot; one sponsor at a time &middot; no contract</p>
      <p class="sp-actions"><a class="btn sp-btn" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Sponsoring%20the%20newsletter">Book a month</a> <a class="sp-link-light" href="#what-you-get">See what you get</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="container">
    <section class="sp-block">
      <h2>Your business, in front of local homeowners</h2>
    <div class="sponsor-stats">
      <div class="sponsor-stat">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M3.5 6.5l8.5 6.5 8.5-6.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg>
        <p class="sponsor-stat-num">{{ a.opensPerMonth }}+</p>
        <p class="sponsor-stat-label">newsletter opens every month</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sponsor-stat">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3c2.8 3 2.8 15 0 18M12 3c-2.8 3-2.8 15 0 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>
        <p class="sponsor-stat-num">{{ a.visitsPerMonth | string | replace(r/\B(?=(\d{3})+(?!\d))/g, ",") }}+</p>
        <p class="sponsor-stat-label">website visits a month</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sponsor-stat">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3l2.6 5.6 6.1.6-4.6 4.1 1.3 6-5.4-3.1-5.4 3.1 1.3-6-4.6-4.1 6.1-.6z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <p class="sponsor-stat-num">1</p>
        <p class="sponsor-stat-label">sponsor a month: just you, with no other adverts beside you</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    </section>

    <section class="sp-block sp-why">
      <div class="sp-card">
        <h3>Seen in a good light</h3>
        <p>A positive, trusted community newsletter, with no politics, no gambling and nothing to argue about. Your name sits alongside village events, church services and local news that people actually read.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sp-card">
        <h3>Supporting your community</h3>
        <p>Your sponsorship keeps a free community resource running for everyone in the villages. It's a simple, visible part of your corporate social responsibility. 100% of sponsorship money goes towards the running costs of the website and newsletter.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sp-block" id="what-you-get">
      <h2>What you get</h2>
      <ul class="sp-ticks">
        <li><svg class="sp-tick" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="11" fill="currentColor" opacity=".15"/><path d="M7 12.5l3.2 3.2L17 9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span>A &ldquo;Supported this month by&rdquo; band with your logo, name, one line and a link near the top of every issue that month.</span></li>
        <li><svg class="sp-tick" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="11" fill="currentColor" opacity=".15"/><path d="M7 12.5l3.2 3.2L17 9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span>The same at the top of the website's home page for the whole month.</span></li>
        <li><svg class="sp-tick" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="11" fill="currentColor" opacity=".15"/><path d="M7 12.5l3.2 3.2L17 9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span>A thank-you mention in the newsletter.</span></li>
      </ul>
    <div class="sponsor-examples">
      <figure>
        <img src="{{ '/images/sponsors/example-newsletter-1.jpg' | url }}" width="720" height="405" alt="Example: the top of a Lenches newsletter with a 'Supported this month by' band showing the Acme Estate Agents logo, name and one line" loading="lazy">
        <figcaption>In the newsletter, every Thursday</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <img src="{{ '/images/sponsors/example-website-1.jpg' | url }}" width="720" height="374" alt="Example: the top of the Lenches website home page with the same band for Acme Estate Agents under the village skyline" loading="lazy">
        <figcaption>On the website's home page, all month</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <p class="muted sponsor-examples-note">Acme Estate Agents is a made-up example.</p>

    </section>

    <section class="sp-block sp-price-row">
      <div class="sp-price">
        <h2>Price</h2>
        <p class="sp-price-num">&pound;{{ sponsors.price }}</p>
        <p class="sp-price-per">for the calendar month</p>
        <ul class="sp-ticks">
          <li><svg class="sp-tick" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="11" fill="currentColor" opacity=".15"/><path d="M7 12.5l3.2 3.2L17 9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span>Usually an allowable business expense (check with your accountant).</span></li>
          <li><svg class="sp-tick" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="11" fill="currentColor" opacity=".15"/><path d="M7 12.5l3.2 3.2L17 9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span>We're not VAT registered.</span></li>
          <li><svg class="sp-tick" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="11" fill="currentColor" opacity=".15"/><path d="M7 12.5l3.2 3.2L17 9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span>One month at a time, with no contract to tie you in.</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p><a class="btn sp-btn" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Sponsoring%20the%20newsletter">Book a month</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="sp-steps">
        <h2>Easy to arrange</h2>
        <ol>
          <li><strong>Choose your month.</strong> Reply to our email, or write to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Sponsoring%20the%20newsletter">{{ site.email }}</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Send your logo</strong> and a line of up to 15 words.</li>
          <li><strong>Pay by bank transfer or card</strong>, and you're done.</li>
        </ol>
        <h3>Even easier to repeat</h3>
        <p>To book again, just reply &ldquo;same again&rdquo;.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sp-block">
      <h2>Can we help?</h2>
      <p>Sponsors can promote their own events and/or offers throughout the year for a small additional charge.</p>
    <figure class="sponsor-example-one">
      <img src="{{ '/images/sponsors/example-event-1.jpg' | url }}" width="720" height="278" alt="Example: a 'Meet the team' event from Acme Estate Agents in the newsletter's Coming up section, marked From our sponsor" loading="lazy">
      <figcaption>A sponsor's event in the newsletter (Acme is a made-up example)</figcaption>
    </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="sp-cta">
      <h2>Ready to support your villages?</h2>
      <p>One month, one sponsor, and a free community newsletter kept going for everyone.</p>
      <p><a class="btn sp-btn" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Sponsoring%20the%20newsletter">Book a month</a></p>
    </section>

    <p class="sp-foot"><a href="{{ '/newsletter/' | url }}">See what the newsletter is about</a> &middot; <a href="{{ '/sponsor/terms/' | url }}">Sponsorship terms</a></p>
  </div>
</main>
